        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
          <choice_text>$\begin{gathered}A \rightarrow R \\ \searrow \\ S\end{gathered}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
          <choice_text>$A \rightarrow R \rightarrow S$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
