[풀이] 옳은 것을 고르는 문제다. 옳은 선지는 ①, 틀린 선지는 ②·③·④이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="O · 정답">
          <choice_text>$C_A0 \frac{1 - X_A}{1 - 0 . 5 X_A}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
          <choice_text>$C_{A0} \frac{1 - X_{A}}{1 + 0 . 5 X_{A}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳지 않은 내용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="X">
